    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39543" root="نخج" body-key="n">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخَجَ الدَّلْوَ</span></b> , (S, K,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخَجَ بِهَا</span>, (TA,)
aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخَجَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخْجٌ</span>, (K,) <i>He agitated,</i> or <i>moved
about, the bucket;</i> (S, K;) a dial. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخَجَ</span>;
(S;) or, accord. to Yaakoob, its <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ن</span> is substituted
for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">م</span>: <i>he moved about the bucket</i> in the well <i>in
order that it might fill.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخَجَ</span>, (S, K,)
aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخَجَ</span></b>  (K) and 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخُجَ</span></b> , (L,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخْجٌ</span>, (K,) <i>Inivit</i>
feminam. (S, K.)


